/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (2024 has been about pushing for impactful change and making sure our work reflects the realities happening in our communities. It has been one of growth, resilience, and impactful change, reaffirming our commitment to empowering women, girls, and young entrepreneurs through technology, education, advocacy and entrepreneurship. )
/E (2024 has been about pushing for impactful change and making sure our work reflects the realities happening in our communities. It has been one of growth, resilience, and impactful change, reaffirming our commitment to empowering women, girls, and young entrepreneurs through technology, education, advocacy and entrepreneurship. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
