219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We have made significant strides in greater transparency and in our initiatives such as the TechsiStars Mentorship Program, Women in Digital Business Initiative, Women in Digital Economy Initiative, GROW.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Additionally, we have fostered accountability and transparency by ensuring that our team including volunteers and partners have clear and active responsibilities and expectations, strengthening our team coordination and partnership engagements. These milestones demonstrate the power of our teamwork and commitment to excellence.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This year has been about pushing for impactful change and making sure our work as a tech and entrepreneurship development organization, reflects the realities happening in our communities. In 2024, we worked alongside other partners to navigate key priorities like STEM Education for girls and women, Digital Business Transformation for Female Entrepreneurs, Tech careers and Professional Development,  Online Safety for Women and Girls, Women and the Creative Economy, Women and Finance, Equity and Inclusion while ensuring critical process improvements in our programmes.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Despite the challenges, we remained steadfast in our mission, developing local solutions and talents, building skills, and fostering inclusive opportunities. In 2025, we look forward to launching new projects, strengthening partnerships, sustaining our influence, and deepening our engagement with the community. We will continue to work collaboratively with individuals and organizations to build an inclusive and vibrant ecosystem that empowers individuals and communities to increase their agency, voice, resilience, and sustained improvement in the quality of their lives and communities.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
