244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Paahibu Space is a technology, education, and entrepreneurship development organization  designned and committed to providing digital solutions to businesses and non-profits while educating and equipping women-onwed businesess and girls with the skills to leverage technonogy for business and career growth, creating pathways for educational access, leadership and economic independence. As an innovation hub based in Ghana, we empower girls and women in STEM and entrepreneurship to transform local challenges into solutions that contibute to global impact . We build a safe, inclusive,enabling environment for all individuals to gain economic empowerment and educational access. Over the years, Paahibu Space has supported more than 500 women-owned small businesses through business development support, over 1,000 individuals through technology and career development training, and 62 communities in advocacy campaigns, reaching 10,000 girls and women.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
