<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our online safety initiatives addressed the growing threats faced by women in digital spaces. Through community-driven projects and strategic partnerships, we created safe online ecosystems where over 5,000 women and girls learned how to navigate and protect themselves from digital risks. From digital literacy workshops to cybersecurity mentorship, these efforts are ensuring that the next generation of women leaders can engage with technology confidently and securely.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
