/E (With climate change disproportionately affecting women, Paahibu Space introduced the Green Artivism Program, merging art, advocacy, and environmental sustainability. This program empowered women and girls to identify environmental issues in their communities and use creative expressions, digital illustrations, storytelling, and visual art, to propose solutions. Beyond advocacy, Green Artivism unlocked pathways into the creative and digital economies, turning environmental action into sustainable economic opportunities.)
