/E (This 5-week virtual program is designed to structure women-owned MSMEs, social impact initiatives and female freelancers in Africa's business and entrepreneurial sector. It provides small businesses, social impact initiatives and freelancers  with knowledge and skills on how to leverage digital tools and support services to address challenges in operations, product/service development, career advancement and team structuring. This year, the program supported 150 entrepreneurs and freelancers from Ghana. )
